# Story 93: Listing & Unsharing (40s)
# Hook: See everything you're sharing, and pull any of it back with one command.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-093-listing-unsharing.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 6

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
See everything you're sharing, and pull any of it back with one command.

[00:03.0 --> 00:09.0]
Start rysh, double-Escape into rysh mode, and share a pane so we have something to manage.

[00:09.0 --> 00:18.0]
##share list is your single source of truth -- every active share in the session, with its scope, mode, and share ID.

[00:18.0 --> 00:28.0]
##unshare pane stops sharing the active pane. The matching commands exist for panegroup, lane, and tab.

[00:28.0 --> 00:37.0]
List again -- the share is gone. Unregistering tears down the UpstreamShareActor and notifies the server.

[00:37.0 --> 00:40.0]
List to audit, unshare to revoke. You stay in control of what leaves your session.

